{"name":"Cuddly Yarn","hex":"#fffce4","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cuddly","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Suitable for cuddling; designed to be cuddled.","Fond of or prone to cuddling."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cuddly"},{"term":"yarn","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A twisted strand of fibre used for knitting or weaving.","Bundles of fibres twisted together, and which in turn are twisted in bundles to form strands, which in their turn are twisted or plaited to form rope."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To tell a story or stories, especially one that is lengthy or unlikely to be true."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/yarn"}],"entries":[{"title":"Hug","blocks":[{"text":"A hug is a form of endearment, found in virtually all human communities, in which two or more people put their arms around the neck, back, under the armpits or waists of one another and hold each other closely. If more than two people are involved, it may be referred to as a group hug."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Wedding_hugs.jpg/330px-Wedding_hugs.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hug"},{"title":"Yarn","blocks":[{"text":"Yarn is a long continuous length of interlocked fibres, used in sewing, crocheting, knitting, weaving, embroidery, ropemaking, and the production of textiles. Thread is a type of yarn intended for sewing by hand or machine. Modern manufactured sewing threads may be finished with wax or other lubricants to withstand the stresses involved in sewing. Embroidery threads are yarns specifically designed for needlework. Yarn can be made of a number of natural or synthetic materials, and comes in a variety of colors and thicknesses. Although yarn may be dyed different colors, most yarns are solid colored with a uniform hue."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Yarn_at_Folklife_-_Stierch.jpg/330px-Yarn_at_Folklife_-_Stierch.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yarn"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/A_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG/500px-A_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/A_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG/1280px-A_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/A_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG/500px-A_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A Yoruba bride and mother","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AA_Yoruba_bride_and_mother.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/2017-08-04-Paul_Reimer-Beach_Volleyball_Medals-043_%2836352501196%29.jpg/500px-2017-08-04-Paul_Reimer-Beach_Volleyball_Medals-043_%2836352501196%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/2017-08-04-Paul_Reimer-Beach_Volleyball_Medals-043_%2836352501196%29.jpg/1280px-2017-08-04-Paul_Reimer-Beach_Volleyball_Medals-043_%2836352501196%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/2017-08-04-Paul_Reimer-Beach_Volleyball_Medals-043_%2836352501196%29.jpg/500px-2017-08-04-Paul_Reimer-Beach_Volleyball_Medals-043_%2836352501196%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Two men hug after a volleyball match in Canada","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A2017-08-04-Paul_Reimer-Beach_Volleyball_Medals-043_(36352501196).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia